{
  "name": "Algenta: log and execute a governed decision",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "b2b6b8b0-1a1a-4a1a-9a1a-000000000001",
      "name": "When clicking \"Execute workflow\"",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-720, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "log_decision",
        "profile": "govern",
        "arguments": "{\n  \"chosen_action\": \"renew\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.9,\n  \"expected_value\": 1250.0\n}"
      },
      "id": "b2b6b8b0-1a1a-4a1a-9a1a-000000000002",
      "name": "Log Decision",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-algenta.algenta",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-500, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "algentaApi": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "Algenta API (self-hosted)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "execute_decision",
        "profile": "execute",
        "decisionId": "={{ $json.decision_id }}",
        "webhookUrl": "https://your-automation.example.com/hooks/renewal"
      },
      "id": "b2b6b8b0-1a1a-4a1a-9a1a-000000000003",
      "name": "Execute Decision",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-algenta.algenta",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-280, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "algentaApi": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "Algenta API (self-hosted)"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "b2b6b8b0-1a1a-4a1a-9a1a-000000000010",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.error }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "exists",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2b6b8b0-1a1a-4a1a-9a1a-000000000004",
      "name": "Blocked by policy?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-60, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b2b6b8b0-1a1a-4a1a-9a1a-000000000020",
              "name": "notify",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "=Execution was blocked by policy gate '{{ $json.gate }}': {{ $json.error }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2b6b8b0-1a1a-4a1a-9a1a-000000000005",
      "name": "Format policy-denial alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [160, -120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b2b6b8b0-1a1a-4a1a-9a1a-000000000021",
              "name": "notify",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "=Decision {{ $json.decision_id }} delivered to {{ $json.webhook_url }} at {{ $json.executed_at }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2b6b8b0-1a1a-4a1a-9a1a-000000000006",
      "name": "Format success receipt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [160, 120]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When clicking \"Execute workflow\"": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Log Decision", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Log Decision": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Execute Decision", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Execute Decision": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Blocked by policy?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Blocked by policy?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Format policy-denial alert", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Format success receipt", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
  "meta": {
    "instructions": [
      "This workflow is a governed-decision example, not a live automation -- the Webhook URL above",
      "points at a placeholder (https://your-automation.example.com/hooks/renewal). Replace it with",
      "your own downstream automation endpoint before running for real.",
      "",
      "1. Create an 'Algenta API' credential pointing at your own self-hosted Algenta Engine's base",
      "   URL (e.g. http://localhost:8000), with an API key if your engine requires one.",
      "2. Log Decision runs under the 'govern' profile and persists a decision record.",
      "3. Execute Decision runs under the 'execute' profile. 'Continue on Fail' is enabled on this",
      "   node (onError: continueRegularOutput) so a policy-blocked call flows into the branch below",
      "   instead of stopping the workflow -- this is exactly the shape the package's own",
      "   'continueOnFail turns a blocked execution into an item-level error' test exercises.",
      "4. Blocked by policy? branches on whether the item carries an 'error' field (set by this",
      "   node's blocked-call handling) to tell a policy denial apart from a real ExecutionReceipt.",
      "",
      "See typescript/n8n-nodes-algenta/packages/n8n-nodes-algenta/README.md for the full node",
      "reference (operations, tool profiles, and why this node needs a real dependency)."
    ]
  }
}
